This Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation; provided, the amended provisions of the location column for the Jeonbuk Regional Post Office listed in Appendix 1 shall enter into force on January 18, 2024, and the amended provisions of Appendix 2 shall enter into force on December 30, 2023.
Article 2 (Transitional measures concerning prescribed number of public official)
Where the current number of public officials exceeding the prescribed number of those of affiliated agencies with Korean Post, reduced by this Decree entering into force, corresponds to 55 (4 public officials in Grade VI,19 public officials in Grade VII,25 public officials in Grade VIII, and 7 public officials in Grade IX), separate quotas corresponding thereto shall be deemed assigned to the affiliated agencies with Korea Post until the current excess public officials equal the prescribed number of public officials referred to in this Decree.

